"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"add","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"state","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds a state type to the simulation, starting in the given state."}],"title":"add(state:)","url":"\/documentation\/simulationmodule\/simulation\/add(state:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://SimulationModule/documentation/SimulationModule/States":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/States","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"States"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"States"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type whose values are the states a simulation can be in."}],"title":"States","url":"\/documentation\/simulationmodule\/states","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://SimulationModule/documentation/SimulationModule/Simulation":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A world and its schedules by label, advanced one frame at a time.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Simulation"}],"url":"\/documentation\/simulationmodule\/simulation","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Simulation"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Simulation","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation"},"doc://SimulationModule/documentation/SimulationModule/Simulation/update(elapsed:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Advances the simulation by one frame."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"update"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"elapsed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"